{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"wild_goose","model_identifier":"wild_goose","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# wild_goose\n\nWild goose (Patch 5): a greylag goose, made from `chicken_hen`.\n\nGrey-brown body and wings with paler barring and a darker back, a pale belly and under-tail, a long grey-brown neck, an orange beak with a pale tip and pink-orange legs; about 1.4 times the hen. Every hen bone and clip is kept; the `head` pivot moved to the top of the neck (0, 24, -4.7), so `peck` dips the head but does not reach the ground.\n\n- Cubes: 24. Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Bounds at rest: x -6..6, y 0..28, z -11..12 u.\n- Clips: `idle`, `walk`, `run`, `peck`, `flap`, `sit`, `injured`, `death`.\n\n## Clips (Patch 5 addition)\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `mate` | 2.0 | loop | Patch 5: a gentle nuzzle toward the partner on the model's left (head and neck turn, body sway, tail wag; birds fluff their wings, the hare hops), played by two animals side by side while the game draws hearts over them. |"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"flat_body#7a7468","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,6.2,-4.5],"to":[4.5,13,6.5],"autouv":0,"color":1,"origin":[-4.5,6.2,-4.5],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[22,11,31,18],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,11,11,18],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[31,11,40,18],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[11,11,22,18],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,9,11],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[9,0,18,11],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8ff537b7-f4eb-3d6e-0c49-4bbd74c1bd0f"},{"name":"flat_breast#9a9488","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":